// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Shelly_Percey 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Shelly Percey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1185848907" "Dr. Shelly Percey"
// ProfessionString :
"P649771644" "Doctor"
// DescriptionString :
"P837540614" "Shelly Percey left medical school in disgrace during her third year, when one of her professors found her performing unethical experiments on an injured hero. Since her fall from grace, Shelly's kept herself busy providing medical services to the less scrupulous metahumans to be found by the dozen in the Rogue Isles. She doesn't stoop to treating those without super powers, and she's become quite an expert in her somewhat rarified field. She owes her mastery of the metahuman physique to her insatiable curiosity, which has gotten her into trouble more than a few times."
// HelloString :
"P3872775334" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have something I'd like you to look into.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P4254789590" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are still a few things I'm curious about.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1532442393" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's see what we can learn.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P121698570" "I don't believe we've met, and I won't consider dealing with you until you've built up your reputaion with the brokers on Cap au Diable. They're on your map."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3813968346" "Welcome, {VillainName}. I am Dr. Shelly Percey. I've come to know a great deal about you metahumans, but there's still plenty we can learn together. Are you game?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3816670767" "We've got no more ground to cover together. Maybe one of your other contacts has a project for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3430099923" "You're a bit busy to be looking for more work, yes?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2950859781" "I have something, but it could get dicey. Let's wait until you reach Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3474409576" "I'd like to think we're becoming friends, {VillainName}. I'd like to, but I don't quite trust you yet. Why don't you check in with me regularly, by phone? And perhaps buy a few of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A> That might help me trust you more."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1624788124" "We have made some fascinating discoveries together, my friend. I'm pleased to have you on my side. If there are any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you need, please tell me."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3526706893" "We've got nothing more to teach one another, I'm afraid."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2976172791" "Have you met Dr. Shelly Percey? Technically, she's not a real doc, since she got kicked out of medical school for, shall we say, unorthodox techniques. But she's been using that title since she's been here. She's deeply interested in super powers, both natural and artificially created. She can give you some good tips on the Goldbrickers. She's got a lot of connections in the medical community, which get her Mutation and Science Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2922958529" "Choose Dr. Shelly Percey"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4033817972" "Shelly's a bit strange. Scary, even. Sometimes I think her thirst for knowledge has made her a little insane."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2256164445" "There's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I think you would work well with."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2608615576" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> I know would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


